  "description": "Global Metadata: Cinematic Indie Electronic & Warm Acoustic, 112 BPM, Warm, inspiring cinematic score starting with intimate felt piano and subtle analog synth pulses at 5 a.m., building with crisp rhythmic percussion, acoustic guitar harmonics, and lush orchestral strings into a radiant, uplifting sunrise climax. Clean mix leaving warm midrange space for the voiceover. Loud polished master.\n\nVocal Details: Instrumental, no lyrics, no vocals, no choir.\n\nArrangement: [Éveil à l'aube] at 0 seconds: Intimate felt piano notes and a soft, ticking analog pulse evoking 5 a.m. quiet focus. [Étincelle créative] at 8 seconds: Warm sub-bass, shimmering arpeggios, and a crisp snare groove enter as the sketch transforms into 3D and video. [Prendre forme] at 21 seconds: Driving rhythmic acoustic guitar, rich cello phrases, and tactile percussive hits accompanying the print transformations. [Ouverture au soleil] at 32 seconds: Full, radiant cinematic swell with soaring strings and warm brass, resolving on a bright, resonant final piano chord at 42.5s. Strong hits at 2.5, 7.5, 10.5, 13.0, 18.5, 23.5, 31.5, 37.0, 42.5 seconds. Clean ending at 48 seconds.",
